Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:24.34,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Dang, that thing's the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:27.06,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,This is such a messed up job. Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:30.12,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Still, I bet I'll breeze through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.74,0:02:07.08,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 10: REUNION
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.86,0:02:05.16,Italics,Bookseller,0,0,0,,"To Miss Witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.63,0:02:07.17,Italics,Bookseller,0,0,0,,Have you been well?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.64,0:02:09.47,Italics,Bookseller,0,0,0,,In the time that you've been away,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.86,0:02:12.67,Italics,Bookseller,0,0,0,,the air and water in \Nthe town have turned filthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.06,0:02:17.83,Italics,Bookseller,0,0,0,,My body is in such pain that I can't \Ngo outside, so every day is depressing."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.49,0:02:35.01,Italics,Bookseller,0,0,0,,"I dearly wish that you \Nwould visit again soon."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:40.57,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,The owner of the bookstore \Nsent a kind of SOS letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.57,0:02:44.54,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,so Miss Witch decided to visit the city\N for the first time in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:54.53,Flashback,Claude,0,0,0,,You oughta give up on going to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.53,0:02:58.06,Flashback,Claude,0,0,0,,The End of All Things showed up near \Nthe border recently and thanks to that,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.06,0:03:02.36,Flashback,Claude,0,0,0,,refugees have been pouring into \Nthe city, so things aren't looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:05.18,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,The crow tried to stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.91,0:03:08.75,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Is there some reason why \Nyou still want to go
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:13.40,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,even if it might mean \Nfacing danger, Miss Witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.91,0:03:17.76,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,If he sent a letter, it must be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.04,0:03:23.58,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Also, he said he was in pain, so \NI want to bring him some medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:25.51,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Miss Witch...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.07,0:03:27.18,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:30.81,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Nah, there's more to it than that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.79,0:03:36.62,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You've never gotten a letter \Nfrom a human before now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.62,0:03:39.53,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You let it go to your head and \Nnow you can't stop yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:42.65,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.56,0:03:44.54,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,What? Is that why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.54,0:03:46.19,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.84,0:03:49.15,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,N-No. Absolutely wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.90,0:03:49.61,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.61,0:03:52.55,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Chomping at the bit after \None pathetic little letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.10,0:03:54.79,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,What an easy woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.06,0:03:59.05,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You know, all you are to that \Nbook guy is a cleaning lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.05,0:04:00.55,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.85,0:04:06.55,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I see. You must have always \Nwanted a pen pal, Miss Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.55,0:04:08.31,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.89,0:04:11.05,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,No kidding. That's adorbs! How precious!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.53,0:04:19.09,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,But to be honest, I don't want \NMiss Witch to go to town, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.09,0:04:22.33,Default,Villager A,0,0,0,,What're all these nasty \Nmushrooms poppin' up fer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.33,0:04:25.01,Default,Villager B,0,0,0,,Ain't that the Champignon Witch there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.01,0:04:30.33,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,The mushrooms she's sprouting are \Na lot bigger than normal. I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.57,0:04:33.08,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.08,0:04:34.12,Default,Villager C,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.12,0:04:35.34,Default,Villager D,0,0,0,,It's talkin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:36.43,Default,Villager E,0,0,0,,Run like heck!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.43,0:04:38.65,Default,Villager C,0,0,0,,Her breath's s'posed to be poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.65,0:04:40.59,Default,Villager E,0,0,0,,Terrifyin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:43.53,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,There's probably no \Npoint trying to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.53,0:04:47.85,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,But if the villagers are acting like this,\N I have a bad feeling about the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.95,0:05:01.05,Default,Villager B,0,0,0,,Careful, Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.05,0:05:04.61,Default,Villager B,0,0,0,,If you hold onto the witch like that, \Nyou're gonna get poisoned and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.97,0:05:06.22,Default,Villager B,0,0,0,,C'mon over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.66,0:05:11.94,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:18.09,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Miss Witch isn't at all dangerous \Nlike the rumors say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.09,0:05:20.38,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,See? I'm the proof of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.77,0:05:24.63,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,And if you leave the mushrooms be, \Nthey'll wither up on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.63,0:05:27.17,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,This should explain everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.17,0:05:29.47,Default,Villager H,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.21,0:05:37.70,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Did my power help Miss Witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.78,0:05:43.65,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I was able to protect her, \Neven though I'm so small!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.08,0:05:48.44,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.70,0:05:58.42,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Luna, your right hand and right \Nfoot are moving together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.67,0:06:01.51,Default,Villager F,0,0,0,,Then what were those \Nrumors in town all about,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.51,0:06:05.57,Default,Villager F,0,0,0,,sayin' that black witches summon \Na monster called The End of All Things?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.45,0:06:09.87,Default,Villager G,0,0,0,,Could be a load of bunk, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.87,0:06:11.27,Default,Villager H,0,0,0,,You might be right, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.27,0:06:12.68,Default,Villager F,0,0,0,,How would we know, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.94,0:06:14.03,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.03,0:06:18.44,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Why do I have this strange feeling again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.07,0:06:20.46,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,The End of All Things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.95,0:06:25.55,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Every time I hear that name, \Nit wears away my happy feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:28.11,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,and fills my heart with dread.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.98,0:06:35.47,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Oh. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.80,0:06:44.05,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I gotta keep it together. \NI have to protect Miss Witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.85,0:07:09.00,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,This is... the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:14.39,Default - Top,Speaker,0,0,0,,If you touch The End of All Things, \Nyour skin turns black and rots off
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.39,0:07:16.36,Default - Top,Speaker,0,0,0,,and the air fills with this stench that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.36,0:07:20.34,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Is that man speaking one of \Nthe refugees from the border
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.34,0:07:23.00,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,who escaped The End of All Things?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.36,0:07:18.66,Default - Top,Speaker,0,0,0,,if you breathe it, eats away \Nat you from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:23.00,Default - Top,Speaker,0,0,0,,The land that it poisons \Ncan't be used for a decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.49,0:07:26.01,Default,Speaker,0,0,0,,The heresy and faithlessness \Nin your heart
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.01,0:07:28.26,Default,Speaker,0,0,0,,is what attracts The End of All Things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.67,0:07:30.19,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,The End of All Things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.79,0:07:34.22,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,The pollution in town is \Neven worse than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:36.76,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,You gotta be strong and support Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.59,0:07:43.62,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Ain't that her? The witch who grows \Nall them bad poison mushrooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:45.25,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,I'm gonna slay her myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.65,0:07:46.82,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.82,0:07:49.64,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,What are you doing? \NWhat if she curses you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:51.90,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,But that's what the man at \Nthe fountain was saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.31,0:07:56.23,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,She summons The End of All Things \N'cause she's mad about being an outcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.23,0:07:58.77,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,The black witch is an evil heretic!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.77,0:08:01.36,Default,Man A,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:06.42,Default,Man A,0,0,0,,My girl ate one of the witch's mushrooms \Nand suffered for a whole month!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.29,0:08:11.21,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,That's wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.21,0:08:14.45,Default,Man A,0,0,0,,Begone, you cursed demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.67,0:08:16.79,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.69,0:08:32.58,Default,Man A,0,0,0,,A hand grew out of the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:34.69,Default,Man C,0,0,0,,A dead man's hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.26,0:08:38.08,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Boy oh boy, oh boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.42,0:08:40.82,Default,Person,0,0,0,,You evil necromancer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.51,0:08:44.96,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Miss Witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.45,0:08:51.59,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Stop it! You don't understand! \NPlease listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.85,0:08:57.19,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,What now? My charm power \Nisn't working on them at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.15,0:09:00.43,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:14.78,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Luna, let's escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.13,0:09:20.22,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,There's no point in growing mushrooms \Nhere and Lize is acting kind of strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.76,0:09:21.77,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.38,0:09:27.61,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Not when the situation is this bad. \NIf I don't do what I can now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.57,0:09:33.59,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Oh, moo. You shouldn't be wasting \Nany of your time on these meanies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.59,0:09:35.22,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Just leave them be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.33,0:09:38.20,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Lu—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.53,0:09:42.67,Default,Lize/Minos,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.72,0:09:44.71,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.72,0:09:44.71,Default - Top,Minos,0,0,0,,Moo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.51,0:09:48.67,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Why, Miss Witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.57,0:09:52.40,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous! Please don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.75,0:09:57.06,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,No! I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.64,0:09:58.69,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I really don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.79,0:10:03.41,Default,Man D,0,0,0,,You're gonna grow more? Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.35,0:10:05.66,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Right in front of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:07.93,Default - Top,Person,0,0,0,,Nice shot! Got her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:10.67,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,something terrible is happening \Nto the person I adore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:16.67,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,And I can't protect her. She protected \Nme instead. I couldn't even shield her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.30,0:10:20.41,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Why am I so weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.22,0:10:51.86,Default,Woman A,0,0,0,,Don't you think that's going too far?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:54.17,Default,Woman B,0,0,0,,The mushrooms are one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.17,0:10:57.55,Default,Woman B,0,0,0,,but the End of All Things stuff \Nseems a little far-fetched.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.90,0:11:02.31,Default,Person,0,0,0,,And the air around the mushrooms \Nalways seems like it's clearer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.31,0:11:03.69,Default,Person,0,0,0,,It sure is refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.64,0:11:07.09,Default,Person,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.37,0:11:11.43,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,She's so far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:17.57,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,I just remembered something \NLuna told me a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.57,0:11:21.81,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,She was always alone before I came \Nto live with her, so I asked her,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.81,0:11:24.32,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,"Weren't you lonely all the time, Luna?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.78,0:11:27.33,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,And everyone else avoided her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.71,0:11:31.38,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,I said, "Why do you try to purify \Nthe world for people like that?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.01,0:11:35.73,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,"If it was me, I'd hate it so much, \NI'd probably curl up and die," I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.42,0:11:39.34,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,And then Luna said...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.81,0:11:45.50,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,I wasn't alone. The forest was \Nalways right there with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.50,0:11:49.31,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,The forest changes with the seasons, \Nwhich is always exciting to see,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.62,0:11:53.15,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,and the clouds come to greet \Nme each and every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:55.64,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,Sometimes rain and snow do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.64,0:12:01.58,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,Even the moon changes shape every day\N and follows me wherever I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:06.87,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,The sun also watches over me \Nand gives me its blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:10.74,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,Quit trying to act so brave, Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.74,0:12:13.90,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,None of those are people. \NThey aren't even animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:16.03,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,It just makes me feel sad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.03,0:12:19.15,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,I-I'm not acting brave though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.97,0:12:25.29,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,Sometimes I almost forget it, \Nbut the truth is I'm not alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.13,0:12:30.10,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,even if my heart has trouble \Nrecognizing that some days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.10,0:12:31.41,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.41,0:12:34.33,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,My body is poisoned and \NI am a black witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.83,0:12:38.21,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,so I will never be able to share \Nmy life with someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.92,0:12:42.92,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,But if I decided to live for myself alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.47,0:12:46.26,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,I think it would start to \Nmake my heart grow numb,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.67,0:12:49.41,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,and I would eventually be \Nswallowed up by loneliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.23,0:12:54.27,Flashback_Italics,Luna,0,0,0,,So I want to feel connected \Nand wanted, even if just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.89,0:12:59.73,Flashback_Italics,Luna,0,0,0,,However faint it may be, the feeling\N that I'm living to help others
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.73,0:13:01.92,Flashback_Italics,Luna,0,0,0,,is what keeps me alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.19,0:13:05.05,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I can't simply abandon someone like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.45,0:13:12.49,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,But I'm so weak, I'm forcing her\N to walk on alone right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.37,0:13:15.27,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I want to become stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.94,0:13:20.86,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Strong enough that she never \Nhas to walk alone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.70,0:13:22.42,Default - Top,Minos,0,0,0,,Lize, settle down. You're gonna \Ngive Hatter an upset tummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.42,0:13:26.92,Default - Top,Minos,0,0,0,,That isn't very nice. We can't leave \Nhere until Luna says so, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.30,0:13:26.26,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Strong enough that she doesn't feel she \Nhas to sacrifice herself for others.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.92,0:13:27.95,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I want to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.73,0:13:34.12,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,But crying here now, unable to move,\N I feel completely inadequate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:41.65,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I want to be her shield, strong enough \Nthat she'll keep me by her side always.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.34,0:13:44.41,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Even if it means I lose everything else,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.99,0:13:50.97,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I want to become a magician strong \Nenough to do that for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.29,0:13:54.01,Default,White Magician,0,0,0,,You, black witch there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.09,0:14:00.23,Default,White Magician,0,0,0,,Are you the poison witch growing mushrooms\N that are disturbing the peace here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.81,0:14:04.46,Default,White Magician,0,0,0,,Huh. It's interesting that such a toxic \Nwitch has slipped through the net
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.46,0:14:10.24,Default,White Magician,0,0,0,,of the black witch hunts that we \Nwhite witches have been carrying out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:13.24,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,A white magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.62,0:14:24.71,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,A vine?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.65,0:14:27.03,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,It's so strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.58,0:14:31.26,Default,White Magician,0,0,0,,I have an urgent appointment coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.26,0:14:36.06,Default,White Magician,0,0,0,,Why don't you take over for me \Nand toss her into cell block number six?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.06,0:14:37.87,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.87,0:14:40.81,Default,White Magician,0,0,0,,Just be sure not to touch her, Henri.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:43.97,Default,White Magician,0,0,0,,It sounds like she's got enough \Npoison to rot your skin right off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.47,0:14:45.80,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.62,0:15:03.86,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Henri?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.47,0:15:07.47,Flashback,Henri,0,0,0,,Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.75,0:15:23.55,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Well then, you're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.27,0:15:25.67,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Do not try to struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:31.07,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,If you try to run now, it will \Nonly incite the crowd further
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.42,0:15:34.03,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,and fuel their suspicions about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.60,0:15:35.57,Italics,Luna (M),0,0,0,,Henri...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.11,0:15:37.62,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Throw no more stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.16,0:15:46.39,Italics,Luna (M),0,0,0,,Henri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.09,0:15:58.49,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,You are the Champignon Witch, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:00.99,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,You should be safe from them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.67,0:16:02.31,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.61,0:16:07.23,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,I am an officer of the crown and \Na descendant of the white witches,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.04,0:16:10.57,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,but I unfortunately cannot use magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.86,0:16:15.58,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,so the only one with the magic to untie \Nthat vine is the person who cast it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.90,0:16:19.90,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,But I wonder if your powers as\N a black witch are also enough to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.25,0:16:26.84,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Oh... You must be confused. \NOf course you are. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.66,0:16:32.84,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,You'll be all right. The people who are\N after you won't come out this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.88,0:16:37.71,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,You're injured. That must have hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.63,0:16:44.85,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh! What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.85,0:16:50.23,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Amazing! The wizard who conjured \Nthat vine is actually very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.43,0:16:53.82,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Huh. My handkerchief is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.68,0:16:56.60,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,So much for the terrible poison witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:17:00.27,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,But I don't know, this \Nis kind of a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.79,0:17:05.33,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,The rumors do mention mysterious powers, \Nbut you're not at all what I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:11.13,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,The instant I laid eyes on you, all I \Ncould think about was protecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.54,0:17:17.64,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,And I can still tell you're just a normal,\N pretty girl who cries easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.21,0:17:20.44,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,I guess you can't believe the rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.14,0:17:23.39,Italics,Luna (M),0,0,0,,Henri...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.38,0:17:26.76,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Uh-oh. Never mind. We've got to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.25,0:17:30.52,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,You can escape from that exit. \NYou should be able to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.89,0:17:33.29,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Why would you do this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:36.42,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to \Nremember me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.56,0:17:39.34,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,What if they catch you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.25,0:17:44.63,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,I'll be fine. That supervisor from \Nbefore has a terrible memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.99,0:17:47.67,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,He's already forgotten about \Nplenty of his prisoners
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.37,0:17:50.82,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,so I pull this off from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:17:54.83,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,I can't use magic, but if I play \Nmy inability and connections right,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.83,0:18:00.07,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,I can come up with plenty of excuses. \NSo no need to worry. Just get go—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.30,0:18:12.12,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,This is going to sound strange,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.21,0:18:15.19,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,but I feel this isn't \Nthe first time we've met.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.32,0:18:20.52,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Maybe we met in a dream or a former life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.52,0:18:24.45,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Or maybe I'm only being bewitched \Nby your powerful magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.17,0:18:30.76,Flashback,Henri,0,0,0,,Luna, I want you to come with me, to \Nfind what awaits beyond ultimate joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.16,0:18:33.78,Flashback,Henri,0,0,0,,The only thing that scares me\N is the thought of losing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.86,0:18:36.62,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,I have a wife and a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.62,0:18:40.62,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,I don't know why I would even \Nsay that to a girl like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.97,0:18:43.30,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Oh... wait. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.82,0:18:46.03,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Black witches don't grow old, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.38,0:18:49.56,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Wait. No, that's beside the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.15,0:18:55.48,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Please be do careful,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.15,0:18:57.71,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Cha... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.15,0:19:00.76,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Tell me your name. Your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.29,0:19:12.60,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Huh? The heck is that? Holy moly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.56,0:19:15.64,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Wait... something don't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.64,0:19:19.26,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Guess I gotta deal with that first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.67,0:19:24.32,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Huh? We're out of the hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.32,0:19:26.78,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,It looks like there's still \Ntrouble here, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.78,0:19:29.78,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,I wonder if that means \NLuna's magic wore off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.78,0:19:33.81,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like she's back \Nyet. I wonder where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.81,0:19:36.02,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,I wonder if something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.02,0:19:37.32,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Miss Witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.90,0:19:41.53,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Oh! Lize!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.75,0:19:43.41,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,No, it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.41,0:19:47.54,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Miss Witch! Miss Witch, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.46,0:19:50.67,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.41,0:20:03.80,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Lize!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.46,0:20:15.18,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,What is... that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.79,0:20:17.19,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.79,0:20:21.28,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Lize? \NDid any poison get on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:22.82,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Yeah, figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.49,0:20:25.91,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,It already made its way here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.91,0:20:29.19,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,a cursed youngling that was \Ninfected by The End of All Things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.59,0:20:31.59,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Man, this sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.59,0:20:35.13,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I screwed up wiping out \NThe End at the border,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.13,0:20:39.27,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,and if Flame hears that I sprayed bits \Nof it everywhere with that tornado,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.27,0:20:43.32,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,he's gonna flip out! \NAnd that guy's a nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.95,0:20:51.35,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Is there any way to keep it from him? \NMan, this sucks. What am I gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.30,0:20:56.12,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I'm seriously not cut out for \Nthis black magician stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.24,0:21:00.11,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Why are they always \Nnagging about the method?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.82,0:21:03.17,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,As long as it gets done, who cares how?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.92,0:21:07.94,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Man, this makes me wanna quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.94,0:21:11.12,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,What is this guy's problem? \NHe does nothing but complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.55,0:21:13.25,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,He won't stop talking to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.96,0:21:18.32,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,But when he showed up, \Na strong wind started blowing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.27,0:21:18.63,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll run off. But would I really \Nget away or would they catch up to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.32,0:21:22.20,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,and it blew away all of \Nthe lingering blight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.01,0:21:20.68,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,Whatever. Guess I'll see how things go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.95,0:21:28.67,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,And now it feels like that suffocating \Nfeeling inside is being washed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.21,0:21:28.67,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,And I got the report that Luna \Nwas supposed to be here in town,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.67,0:21:31.01,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,so what the heck's that dork doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.29,0:21:33.28,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,You're a friend of Luna's?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.28,0:21:36.86,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that? Are you \Nguys friends with Luna, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.86,0:21:40.02,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Oh crap! Wow. Don't tell her\N what I just said, 'kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.71,0:21:46.35,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Wait. Are you one of the Black Magician \NCouncil members? The Wind Magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.74,0:21:49.70,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Huh? Whoa. What the... what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:52.29,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,How you know that? \NWho're you guys, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.63,0:21:54.05,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Wait. Eww. Barf!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.05,0:21:54.90,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.15,0:21:59.31,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Must be the wrong guy. He's way too crude.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.67,0:22:00.67,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You got a point there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.67,0:22:03.97,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,A Black Magician... Council?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.67,0:22:03.30,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,Huh? Wanna say that again, cow?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.30,0:22:04.25,Default - Top,Minos,0,0,0,,Yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.25,0:22:06.04,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,The Wind Magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.04,0:22:10.68,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Man, you guys aren't any help at all.\N Where is Luna, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.68,0:22:12.81,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Oh. I already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.81,0:22:15.00,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Whoosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.00,0:22:15.56,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.56,0:22:16.53,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.82,0:22:27.48,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.53,0:22:31.63,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.37,0:22:41.50,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,TRANSLATION: MICHAEL ARNOLD
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.79,0:22:46.17,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,SUBTITLE TIMING: ANDY ELLIS\NEDITING: ELISABETH CRIST
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.76,0:22:52.14,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,QUALITY CHECK: GABRIELLA ALABANZA\NTRANSLATION CHECK: MICHELLE TYMON
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.63,0:24:10.27,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,NEXT TIME: THE COUNCILOR
